      "name": "\"Dreamland Equipment\" Glimmering Whiskers",
      "desc": "Can modify Tully's ears into laser emitters that shoot out <color=#E48600>destructive energy beams</color> from their tips. When enemies suffer an <color=#E48600>Attribute Anomaly</color> or become <color=#E48600>Stunned</color>, it uses <color=#E48600>Enhanced Energy Beam</color> to fire a sustained laser attack. When the energy beam hits an enemy, it applies the Weaken effect, increasing the damage they receive.\nCan be upgraded using <color=#E48600>Sharp Edge Dreamland Resonium</color> obtained from the <color=#E48600>modification workshop</color>.\n",
